# slug: ch83-linear
# source: chapters/ch83.tex:73
# label: alg:ch83-linear
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch83.tex:76
# caption: Check a sufficient affine interpretation certificate over natural numbers.

REQUIRE finite rules and nonnegative affine symbol interpretations
ENSURE accepted certificate proves every rule strictly decreasing, or unresolved
require each argument coefficient to be positive
FORALL rules l -> r DO
  compose interpretations to obtain affine forms for l and r
  subtract right coefficients from left coefficients
  require every variable coefficient nonnegative and constant difference positive
END FOR
accept under the stated natural-number interpretation

